  "details": "Owners of group instances of course naturally have the power to kick and ban users which is wonderful, but sometimes having the ability to just start the vote kick process and let the players of the instance collectively decide is the better solution. Group instance owners currently do not have that power. We can only immediately kick or ban. Can you please add another button visible to group instance owners allowing them to start the vote process?",
